<%# Test for HTML to Typst conversion %>
<% html_content = <<~HTML
  <h1>Main Title</h1>
  <h2>Subtitle</h2>
  <p>This is a paragraph with <strong>bold text</strong> and <em>italic text</em>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>First item</li>
    <li>Second item</li>
    <li>Third item</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Here's a <a href="https://typst.app">link to Typst</a>.</p>
HTML
%>

= HTML to Typst Conversion Test

== Direct HTML to Typst
<%= html_to_typst(html_content) %>

== HTML to Markdown (then manual Typst)
<%= html_to_markdown(html_content) %>

== Complex HTML Structure
<% complex_html = <<~HTML
  <h3>Section Title</h3>
  <p>Paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, and <code>code</code>.</p>
  <blockquote>This is a quote</blockquote>
HTML
%>
<%= html_to_typst(complex_html) %>

This document tests HTML to Typst conversion.
